      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go back through the exchange around The Firing line by line and unpack how the Russian works.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Вот полюбуйся.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Take a good look.' After the ambulance leaves, Barinov confronts the sushi chef and tells him to look at the mess.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Это твоя вина.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is your fault.' Viktor blames the newcomer directly for making the customer sick.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Ты человека чуть не угробил.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You nearly killed a man.' He fumes that the bad fish nearly killed a guest in his dining room.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Шеф, хватит.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chef, enough.' Lyova steps in and asks the chef to calm down.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Он не понимает по-русски.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He doesn't understand Russian.' He reminds Viktor that the sushi chef does not understand a word of Russian.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Это продукты от Тимура.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'These are products from Timur.' Barinov realizes the raw fish came from Timur's shady delivery earlier.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Тимур, иди сюда.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Timur, come here.' Lyova calls Timur over to answer for the spoiled ingredients.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Человек отравился.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A person got poisoned.' He informs the supplier that a customer suffered food poisoning because of his fish.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Мы в ваших услугах не нуждаемся.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We do not need your services.' Lyova announces that the restaurant is cutting ties with Timur's company.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Все, свободен.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That's it, you're dismissed.' Barinov waves Timur away, telling him he is dismissed for good.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Это Тигран.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is Tigran.' With Timur gone, Lyova introduces a new supplier to the chef.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Очень приятно, Тигран.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Nice to meet you, Tigran.' Lyova greets the new supplier politely as they set up a fresh supply deal.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Ну, вот и договорились.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well, then it's settled.' Once the terms are set, Lyova shakes hands and declares the deal settled. Now let's listen to the whole conversation again from start to finish.",
